 StyleBox["Figure. ",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 "Fourteen English words drifting through their own neighbourhoods, ",
 "1800s (blue) to 1990s (red)."
}], "Caption",
 CellMargins->{{55, 55}, {2, 
  16}},ExpressionUUID->"f8562fa6-674e-48d3-86f5-1ad3de8b6570"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["6. Nearest-neighbour drift tables", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"f10e0e82-409c-4ec2-bd57-4186176629e7"],

Cell["\<\
The trajectories are summaries of a simpler fact: the list of a word's \
nearest neighbours changes from decade to decade. The neighbours are computed \
by cosine similarity in each decade's own (native) space \[Dash] alignment is \
needed only for the cross-decade picture. A few words, sampled every fifty \
years:\
\>", "Text",
 CellMargins->{{50, 50}, {6, 
  6}},ExpressionUUID->"dfda09d5-23d9-4935-aa13-018715c70901"],

Cell[BoxData[
 StyleBox[
  TagBox[GridBox[{
     {
      StyleBox["\<\"word\"\>",
       StripOnInput->False,
       FontWeight->Bold], 
      StyleBox["\<\"50s\"\>",
       StripOnInput->False,
